{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>משתו</b> — deficient alef. When he exalts himself in the sea and appears, the mighty will fear him, and from the breakings he stirs up in the sea, those present will be cleansed. And if a man reaches him with a sword, it will not rise against him. And the meaning: it will not stand."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:38.413533329Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}